  booktitle    = "{bellingcat}",
  abstract     = "Executive Summary Some reporting of this situation has ignored
                  the context of multiple chemical attacks perpetrated by the
                  Syrian Government. Alex's complaints are not properly placed
                  in context. Alex's claims about chemistry are flawed and
                  hugely overstated. The stated conclusion of a meeting with
